@page "/admin/api"
@rendermode RenderMode.InteractiveServer
@attribute [Authorize(Policy = Wms.Core.MenuKeys.ADMIN_API)]

<PageTitle>WMS — API</PageTitle>

<div class="aiwms-page-header">
    <h2>API</h2>
    <p>API endpoints and integrations exposed by WMS.</p>
</div>

<div class="aiwms-section">
    <p>Base URL: <code>https://bflwms.bflgroup.ae/api/v1</code></p>
    <p>Auth: OAuth2 client-credentials — exchange a client ID/secret at <code>POST /api/v1/oauth/token</code> for a bearer token, then call endpoints with <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code>. Manage client apps under <a href="/admin/api/client-apps">Client Apps</a>.</p>
    <p>Sample endpoint: <code>GET /api/v1/ping</code>.</p>
</div>
